# oracle: dump vtk with dump_modify element, label, double yes, pad, region and thresh, and a % legacy file name (pct0.vtk)
# oracle-files: mod000.vtk mod010.vtk mod020.vtk mod020_boundingBox.vtk pct0.vtk pct0_boundingBox.vtk
# oracle-compare: filerel=1e-7
# Measured with native LAMMPS: max relative error 1.6e-13 on values above 1e-6 in the six files (the mod*.vtk files, written with dump_modify double yes, at steps 0, 10, 20; pct0.vtk is single precision); the largest absolute difference is 5.3e-15. Native build: /home/roy/.local/bin/lmp (b332f28). Engine time about 0.2 s.
units           lj
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
region          half block 0 2 0 4 0 4
group           half region half
set             group half type 2
mass            * 1.0
velocity        all create 1.44 87287 loop geom
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0 2.5
fix             1 all nve
dump            d all vtk 10 mod*.vtk id type vx vy vz
dump_modify     d element Ar Kr label cells double yes pad 3 region half thresh type == 2
dump            e all vtk 20 pct%.vtk id type
thermo_style    custom step pe
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             20
